      <div type="clause" n="6.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 6.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be blæserum. Ða blysieras ond þa ðe ðeof wrecen, beon þæs ilcan ryhtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Incendiaries, and those who avenge a thief, shall be subject to the same law.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And ða blisgeras ⁊ ða ðe ðeof wræcan, beon ðæs ylca wyrþe.</ab>
      </div>
